OL,3,GNEWSA'Cheeky' fees prompts choirs to
OL,4,Apull out of festival headlined by
OL,5,AAndrea Bocelli
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales is the land of song, but there
OL,8,Fmay be distinct lack of voices at a
OL,9,Ffestival in the Principality Stadium
OL,10,Fnext year, because choirs are being
OL,11,Fcharged thousands of pounds to take
OL,12,Fpart.
OL,14,FThe event, billed as the The Land of
OL,15,FSong Festival, will feature
OL,16,Fworld-renowned Italian Tenor Andrea
OL,17,FBocelli, but choirs are pulling out
OL,18,Fbecause of steep costs that include
OL,19,Ffees for individual singers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
