OL,3,GNEWSA'Cheeky' fees prompts choirs to
OL,4,Apull out of festival headlined by
OL,5,AAndrea Bocelli
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuw Watkins, who has performed in the
OL,8,FRoyal Albert Hall and at Wales rugby
OL,9,Fmatches with Glynneath Male Voice
OL,10,FChoir, said: "We couldn't get over it -
OL,11,Fwe've never paid anything before to
OL,12,Fparticipate."
OL,14,FOrganisers The Land of Song Festival
OL,15,Fdid not comment. The Principality
OL,16,FStadium has been asked to comment.
